## DONE

**TASK-ENGINE-FIRST-PLAYER-1** — Mirror matchups must be a coin flip.

### What was wrong
`engine/Engine/DuelEngine.cs` line 103: `firstPlayerSkipsDraw = CurrentPlayerIndex == 0 && TurnNumber == 1`. Dead code — `TurnNumber` is incremented to 2 when `CurrentPlayerIndex` wraps back to 0, so the condition never evaluates true. P0 never skipped their turn-1 draw.

### Fix
Changed to `!state.HasSkippedFirstDraw` with an `else state.HasSkippedFirstDraw = true` branch. Added `HasSkippedFirstDraw` flag to `GameState` with clone + hash support. The draw skip now fires exactly once, for P0 only.

### Before/After mirror P0 win rates (200 games, seed 42, GreedyBot)

